Project-original code
---------------------
The Hardcaml (OCaml) hardware description and generators in hardcaml/, the
configurations in configs/, the firmware in firmware/, the Python reference
model, host recorder and wire scoreboards in test/model/, the reset, FIFO,
engine and processor harnesses ported into formal/, and the ISA,
architecture and firmware documents in docs/ originated in the owner's
asic-lab monorepo (projects/protocol-emulator), where they were written by the
same owner. The owner contributes them to this repository under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. The rest (scripts/, the cocotb tests, the
timing-isolation proof, the Tiny Tapeout wrapper and LibreLane configuration,
and the macro checker) was written for this repository.

src/protocol_emulator_core.v is generated from hardcaml/ by
scripts/generate.sh and is covered by the same license.

The Tiny Tapeout project template (TinyTapeout/ttihp-verilog-template) is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Third-party components
----------------------
models/RM_IHPSG13_1P_64x16_c2.v and models/RM_IHPSG13_1P_core_behavioral.v are
unmodified SRAM simulation models from IHP-Open-PDK
(https://github.com/IHP-GmbH/IHP-Open-PDK, revision
2bbec755dc67ca3db0261c3d6163e15735d66710):
  Copyright 2025 IHP PDK Authors (RM_IHPSG13_1P_64x16_c2.v)
  Copyright 2023 IHP PDK Authors (RM_IHPSG13_1P_core_behavioral.v)
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
models/blackbox/RM_IHPSG13_1P_64x16_c2.v is an interface-only derivative of the
first model. See models/NOTICE.IHP-Open-PDK and models/LICENSE.IHP-Open-PDK.

The fabricated design instantiates IHP RM_IHPSG13_1P_64x16_c2 SRAM hard macros
from the IHP-Open-PDK (Apache License, Version 2.0).
